      "source": [
        "# 🧠 NurtureAI — Child Behaviour & Mental Health Risk Analysis\n",
        "## Complete ML Pipeline | Google Colab Notebook\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dataset:** Child Mind Institute — Problematic Internet Use (Kaggle)\n",
        "**Target:** `sii` — Severity Impairment Index (0=Healthy, 1=Mild, 2=Moderate, 3=Severe)\n",
        "**Metric:** Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK)\n",
        "**Primary Model:** Linear SVM (LinearSVC) — best QWK across all evaluated models\n",
        "\n",
        "### Pipeline Steps:\n",
        "| Step | File | Description |\n",
        "|------|------|-------------|\n",
        "| 1 | `01_data_understanding` | Load & inspect dataset |\n",
        "| 2 | `02_data_cleaning` | Handle nulls, encode, impute |\n",
        "| 3 | `03_eda` | 6 EDA visualisation plots |\n",
        "| 4 | `04_feature_engineering` | Create 5 new features + Behavior Score |\n",
        "| 5 | `05_model_training` | Train **LinearSVC** (primary) + OrdinalGB |\n",
        "| 6 | `06_model_evaluation` | Metrics, confusion matrix, SVM coefficient importance |\n",
        "| 7 | `07_predict_new_child` | Predict risk + recommendations for new children |\n",
        "\n",
        "> 💡 **To use real Kaggle data:** Upload `train.csv` and `test.csv` from [this link](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/child-mind-institute-problematic-internet-use/data) to your Colab session files, then set `USE_REAL_DATA = True` in Step 1.\n"
      ]
    },
