        "---\n",
        "## 🧹 STEP 2 — Data Cleaning\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Transform the raw dataset into a clean, consistent, model-ready format.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Operations performed:**\n",
        "1. **Drop ID columns** — identifiers like `id` carry no predictive information\n",
        "2. **Drop high-missing columns** — columns with >60% nulls are unreliable\n",
        "3. **Encode categoricals** — convert text/binary columns to numbers\n",
        "4. **Remove rows with missing target** — can't train without a label\n",
        "5. **Median imputation** — fill remaining nulls with the column median (robust to outliers)\n"
      ]
    },
