        "|---|---|\n",
        "| `BMI_Category` | Clinical weight category: 0=Underweight, 1=Normal, 2=Overweight, 3=Obese |\n",
        "| `Age_Group` | 0=Child (5–11), 1=Early Teen (12–14), 2=Teen (15–17), 3=Young Adult (18+) |\n",
        "| `Pulse_Pressure` | Systolic BP − Diastolic BP (cardiovascular health indicator) |\n",
        "| `Body_Comp_Index` | Fat % ÷ Fat-Free Mass (body composition quality) |\n",
        "| `Behavior_Score` | **Composite 0–100 index**: 35% sleep + 35% activity + 20% fitness + 10% BMI |\n"
      ]
